{"seq":1,"slug":"why-experimental-design","title":"为何需要实验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/foundations/why-experimental-design","wordCount":1818,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何需要实验设计\">为何需要实验设计</h1><p>一台注塑机有六个可调参数：料温、模温、注射速度、保压压力、保压时间、冷却时间。良率卡在 82%，工程师想推到 95%。最自然的做法是固定其余五个、单独扫一遍料温找到最佳点，再固定料温扫模温，如此一个一个调下去。这套「一次一因素」（OFAT，one-factor-at-a-time）的流程符合直觉、便于归因，却几乎注定找不到真正的最优点——因为良率对料温的最佳值，本身依赖模温取什么值。实验设计存在的全部理由，就是把这类「参数之间会互相影响」的现实，用结构化的试验矩阵正面接住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇要确立的几个对象，后面各章反复使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>实验设计（DOE，design of experiments）</strong>：先规划一组结构化的试验组合、再据此估计各输入因素对响应的影响并优化，而非凭直觉逐个试。</li>\n<li><strong>OFAT（一次一因素）</strong>：固定其余变量、单独扫一个因素的流程，隐含「因素效应互不干扰」的假设。</li>\n<li><strong>析因设计</strong>：让多个因素同时变动、跑遍或跑部分水平组合的设计，使一次试验同时服务于所有因素的效应估计。</li>\n<li><strong>交互作用</strong>：一个因素的效应随另一个因素水平改变的现象；它是 OFAT 在原理上无法表达的参数。</li>\n<li><strong>隐藏的重复</strong>：析因设计中估计某个主效应时全部试验点都参与对比，等效样本量随因素数增长，是「DOE 更省」的代数来源。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括本文的立场：<strong>需要 DOE 的首要理由，是必须把交互作用纳入视野</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ofat-为什么系统性地失败\">OFAT 为什么系统性地失败</h2><p>OFAT 的隐含假设是：每个因素对响应的影响互不干扰，因此可以逐个找各自的最优、再拼起来。这个假设只在响应曲面没有交互、且是平滑单峰时才成立。现实里它经常不成立。</p>\n<p>考虑两个因素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（料温）和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（模温），真实响应含交互项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = \\beta_0 + \\beta_1 x_1 + \\beta_2 x_2 + \\beta_{12} x_1 x_2 + \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\">