s=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3111em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_1^* = -\\beta_1/\\beta_{12} - x_2^{(0)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9368em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3111em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这个解显式地依赖你当初随手固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_2^{(0)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3111em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。换一个起点，OFAT 给出的「最优」就变了。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不为零，OFAT 沿着一条被起点绑架的折线爬山，会停在脊线的侧坡而非真正的峰顶。</p>\n<p>更糟的是效率。OFAT 在每个因素上花掉的试验，只为估计那一个因素的效应，信息无法复用。而析因设计让每次试验同时服务于所有因素的效应估计——这就是下面要量化的「隐藏的重复」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"析因如何用更少的试验得到更多\">析因如何用更少的试验得到更多</h2><p>把两个因素各取低、高两水平（记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span>），全析因要跑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^2 = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 个组合。下表对比 OFAT 与析因在同样「每组合一次」预算下的信息产出：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>试验点</th>\n<th>总运行数</th>\n<th>能估主效应</th>\n<th>能估交互</th>\n<th>每个主效应的有效样本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OFAT（2 因素）</td>\n<td>基准 + 各扫 1 步</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>1 对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全析因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>(−−)(+−)(−+)(++)</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>2 对比（隐藏重复）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全析因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>8 个角点</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>3 个</td>\n<td>全部 3 个二阶 + 1 个三阶</td>\n<td>4 对比/因素</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键洞察叫「隐藏的重复」（hidden replication）：在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 设计里估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的主效应时，用的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mo>−</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mo>+</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mo>−</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mo>+</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(y_{+-}+y_{++})}{2}-\\frac{(y_{--}+y_{-+})}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.355em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2737em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2025em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2737em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">++</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2025em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.355em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2737em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2025em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2737em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−+</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2025em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，四个点全部参与，相当于把每个因素的对比建立在两对数据上。因素越多，这种复用越值钱：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 设计每个主效应都基于四对对比，而 OFAT 还是每因素一对。这就是「DOE 更省」的代数来源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[问题: 多因素影响一个响应] --&gt; B{因素间&lt;br/&gt;是否可能交互?}&#10;  B --&gt;|假设无交互| C[OFAT&lt;br/&gt;逐个调参]&#10;  B --&gt;|可能有交互| D[析因设计&lt;br/&gt;同时变动]&#10;  C --&gt; E[停在脊线侧坡&lt;br/&gt;错过交互]&#10;  D --&gt; F[估出主效应&lt;br/&gt;+全部交互]&#10;  F --&gt; G{因素太多&lt;br/&gt;运行数爆炸?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[部分析因/筛选]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[全析因]\">flowchart TD\n  A[问题: 多因素影响一个响应] --&gt; B{因素间&lt;br/&gt;是否可能交互?}\n  B --&gt;|假设无交互| C[OFAT&lt;br/&gt;逐个调参]\n  B --&gt;|可能有交互| D[析因设计&lt;br/&gt;同时变动]\n  C --&gt; E[停在脊线侧坡&lt;br/&gt;错过交互]\n  D --&gt; F[估出主效应&lt;br/&gt;+全部交互]\n  F --&gt; G{因素太多&lt;br/&gt;运行数爆炸?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[部分析因/筛选]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[全析因]</pre><h2 id=\"交互作用-ofat-原理上看不见的东西\">交互作用：OFAT 原理上看不见的东西</h2><p>交互作用指一个因素的效应随另一个因素的水平而改变。在注塑例子里，「高注射速度」在低模温下提升良率、在高模温下反而拉低良率，这就是料温与模温的交互。OFAT 把每个因素的效应当成常数估计，因此在数学上根本没有交互这个参数的位置——它不是「估得不准」，而是「根本估不出」。</p>\n<p>交互的存在极其普遍。化学反应里温度与催化剂浓度交互、农业里施肥量与灌溉交互、机器学习里学习率与批量大小交互。一个不能估交互的实验流程，会反复在「单独调每个参数都没用、合起来调才有效」的问题上撞墙。本 hub 把交互作用的完整定义与几何直觉放在 <a href=\"../designs/factorial-designs\">析因设计</a> 详讲，这里只确立一点：需要 DOE 的首要理由，就是要把交互纳入视野。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实验设计的三类目标\">实验设计的三类目标</h2><p>并非所有 DOE 都为同一件事。明确目标决定了后面选哪种设计：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>筛选（screening）</strong>：因素很多（十几二十个），先快速识别哪几个真正重要。这一步追求运行数极省，容忍效应间的混杂，主力是 <a href=\"../designs/fractional-factorial\">部分析因</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>刻画与建模（characterization）</strong>：因素不多，要把主效应和交互估准，理解系统如何运作。全析因是黄金标准。</li>\n<li><strong>优化（optimization）</strong>：已知重要因素，要找到使响应最大/最小的连续配置。需要二阶曲面，主力是 <a href=\"../analysis/response-surface\">响应曲面</a> 与 <a href=\"../analysis/optimal-designs\">最优设计</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>支撑这三类目标可靠性的，是随机化、重复、区组三条共同原理，详见 <a href=\"principles-randomization\">随机化-重复-区组三原则</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"现代工具让-doe-不再是专家专利\">现代工具让 DOE 不再是专家专利</h2><p>DOE 不是新东西——Fisher 在 1920 年代的洛桑农业试验站就奠定了它。但过去它被困在统计专家手里，普通工程师望而生畏。2026 年的格局已大不相同：JMP 的自定义设计器、Minitab 的设计向导能在几次点击内生成并分析复杂设计，Python 的 <code>pyDOE3</code>、<code>statsmodels</code> 把析因矩阵生成和 ANOVA 变成几行代码，定义筛选设计这类近十年才成熟的方法（Jones 与 Nachtsheim 2011 年提出）也已内置于主流软件（<a href=\"https://www.jmp.com/en/statistics-knowledge-portal/design-of-experiments/screening-designs/definitive-screening-designs\">JMP Definitive Screening Designs 知识门户</a>）。工具门槛的降低，意味着「该不该学 DOE」的答案在今天比任何时候都更明确：会。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>OFAT 隐含「无交互」假设，一旦因素间有交互，它会停在被起点绑架的次优点，且无法复用试验信息。</li>\n<li>全析因通过「隐藏的重复」让每次试验服务于所有因素的效应估计，因素越多越省。</li>\n<li>交互作用是 OFAT 在原理上无法表达的参数，正是需要 DOE 的首要理由。</li>\n<li>DOE 有三类目标——筛选、刻画、优化——各对应不同设计；目标先于设计。</li>\n<li>现代软件（JMP/Minitab/Python）已把 DOE 的门槛降到工程师可日常使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>三条支撑可靠性的原理：<a href=\"principles-randomization\">随机化-重复-区组三原则</a></li>\n<li>交互作用的完整定义与析因矩阵：<a href=\"../designs/factorial-designs\">析因设计</a></li>\n<li>互联网语境下的受控实验对照：<a href=\"../../../data-science/ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design/experiment-design-principles\">AB 测试的实验设计原则</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何需要实验设计","id":"为何需要实验设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"OFAT 为什么系统性地失败","id":"ofat-为什么系统性地失败"},{"level":2,"text":"析因如何用更少的试验得到更多","id":"析因如何用更少的试验得到更多"},{"level":2,"text":"交互作用：OFAT 原理上看不见的东西","id":"交互作用-ofat-原理上看不见的东西"},{"level":2,"text":"实验设计的三类目标","id":"实验设计的三类目标"},{"level":2,"text":"现代工具让 DOE 不再是专家专利","id":"现代工具让-doe-不再是专家专利"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"随机化-重复-区组三原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/foundations/principles-randomization"}}